  <diagram id="HwJyiKwqX9dkWUHkQMFB" name="Halaman-2">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1309" dy="811" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml\nleft to right direction\nskinparam usecase {\n    BackgroundColor white\n    BorderColor black\n}\nskinparam actor {\n    BackgroundColor white\n    BorderColor black\n}\nskinparam shadow false\n\ntitle Use Case Diagram Keseluruhan Sistem PT Talentyca\n\n&#39; === AKTOR KIRI ===\nactor \&quot;Karyawan\&quot; as kar\nactor \&quot;Atasan\&quot; as ats\nactor \&quot;Klien Perusahaan\&quot; as klien\nactor \&quot;Peserta Tes\&quot; as pes\n\n&#39; === AKTOR KANAN ===\nactor \&quot;Tim Finance / HR\&quot; as hr\nactor \&quot;Product Manager\&quot; as pm\nactor \&quot;Engineer\&quot; as eng\nactor \&quot;QA\&quot; as qa\nactor \&quot;Chatbot\&quot; as bot\nactor \&quot;Tim Support\&quot; as sup\n\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; 1. SISTEM KEPEGAWAIAN &amp; KEUANGAN\n&#39; =========================================================\nusecase \&quot;Mengelola Administrasi\\nKepegawaian &amp; Keuangan\&quot; as uc_hr\n\n&#39; Sub-fitur (Satelit)\nusecase \&quot;Melakukan Presensi\&quot; as hr_1\nusecase \&quot;Mengelola Cuti\&quot; as hr_2\nusecase \&quot;Mengajukan Reimbursement\&quot; as hr_3\nusecase \&quot;Meminta Slip Gaji\&quot; as hr_4\n\n&#39; Relasi Aktor ke Pusat\nkar -- uc_hr\nats -- uc_hr\nhr -- uc_hr\n\n&#39; Relasi Pusat ke Sub-fitur\nuc_hr ..&gt; hr_1 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nuc_hr ..&gt; hr_2 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nuc_hr ..&gt; hr_3 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nuc_hr ..&gt; hr_4 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; 2. SISTEM LAYANAN ASSESSMENT\n&#39; =========================================================\nusecase \&quot;Mengelola Layanan\\nAssessment Klien\&quot; as uc_assess\n\n&#39; Sub-fitur (Satelit)\nusecase \&quot;Menginput Data Peserta\&quot; as as_1\nusecase \&quot;Mengerjakan Tes\&quot; as as_2\nusecase \&quot;Melihat Laporan Hasil\&quot; as as_3\n\n&#39; Relasi Aktor ke Pusat\nklien -- uc_assess\npes -- uc_assess\n\n&#39; Relasi Pusat ke Sub-fitur\nuc_assess ..&gt; as_1 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nuc_assess ..&gt; as_2 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nuc_assess ..&gt; as_3 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; 3. SISTEM DEVELOPMENT PRODUK\n&#39; =========================================================\nusecase \&quot;Mengelola Development\\nProduk Aplikasi\&quot; as uc_dev\n\n&#39; Sub-fitur (Satelit)\nusecase \&quot;Membuat Spesifikasi Task\&quot; as dev_1\nusecase \&quot;Mengembangkan Fitur\&quot; as dev_2\nusecase \&quot;Melakukan Testing\&quot; as dev_3\n\n&#39; Relasi Aktor ke Pusat\npm -- uc_dev\neng -- uc_dev\nqa -- uc_dev\n\n&#39; Relasi Pusat ke Sub-fitur\nuc_dev ..&gt; dev_1 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nuc_dev ..&gt; dev_2 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nuc_dev ..&gt; dev_3 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; 4. SISTEM BUG &amp; TICKETING\n&#39; =========================================================\nusecase \&quot;Menangani Pelaporan\\nBug &amp; Ticketing\&quot; as uc_bug\n\n&#39; Sub-fitur (Satelit)\nusecase \&quot;Melaporkan Kendala\&quot; as bug_1\nusecase \&quot;Mengekstrak Format\&quot; as bug_2\nusecase \&quot;Menangani Isu Dasar\&quot; as bug_3\nusecase \&quot;Melakukan Hotfix (L3)\&quot; as bug_4\n\n&#39; Relasi Aktor ke Pusat\npes -- uc_bug\nbot -- uc_bug\nsup -- uc_bug\neng -- uc_bug\n\n&#39; Relasi Pusat ke Sub-fitur\nuc_bug ..&gt; bug_1 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nuc_bug ..&gt; bug_2 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nuc_bug ..&gt; bug_3 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nuc_bug ..&gt; bug_4 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n@enduml&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="-kbYv4PrenLOp9TNMG3O-3">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="1148" width="715" x="810" y="60" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
